# Rootrider Faun: "{T}: Add {G}." is a mana ability with the tap symbol, so the creature cannot use it the turn it comes under its controller's control (CR 302.6, 605.1a).
# Turn 1: a Black Lotus pays for the Faun; its mana ability is refused. Turn 3 it taps for {G} alone and is tapped.
[Bot1 Deck]
Rootrider Faun
Black Lotus
Forest x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Rootrider Faun.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Battlefield.Rootrider Faun.Activate()
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Rootrider Faun.Activate(Ability: {T}: Add {G})
? Bot1.Mana = {G}
? Bot1.Battlefield.Rootrider Faun.Tapped = true

